                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "18669c79-863f-311a-a8c0-f5a1d7b88797",
                                        "entry_id": "f6760577-9d05-360f-8c56-c0ebbeb54b95",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Emotional involvement or engagement in a text read aloud rendered by the voice of the reciter or the reader."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "88b97059-3845-47fc-b97f-cd45b6d664d0",
                                                "sense_id": "18669c79-863f-311a-a8c0-f5a1d7b88797",
                                                "text": "The number of children who could read with expression would be very small ; ..."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4858eaf9-d544-4c86-897b-e8a66dccd290",
                                                "sense_id": "18669c79-863f-311a-a8c0-f5a1d7b88797",
                                                "text": "I cannot say that all read with expression. Indeed , this power is hardly to be expected in young children . And though “ to read with expression ..."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "27da7af2-0b72-4da3-8c35-38ddccbeec7c",
                                                "sense_id": "18669c79-863f-311a-a8c0-f5a1d7b88797",
                                                "text": "1976, Aline D. Wolf, Tutoring is Caring: You Can Help Someone to Read, Parent Child Press\nPerhaps when you were learning to read , you were asked to stand and \" read with expression \" for your classmates"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fd22bd2a-008a-4bd0-8214-f385a1e30d16",
                                                "sense_id": "18669c79-863f-311a-a8c0-f5a1d7b88797",
                                                "text": "To read with expression, readers must know when to pause appropriately, must know when to change their tone to reflect the emotions of different characters, ..."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "669dc54a-cee3-4814-9f96-0b32e5017d82",
                                                "sense_id": "18669c79-863f-311a-a8c0-f5a1d7b88797",
                                                "text": "Think of reading words like reading music. When you read with expression, your audience will understand and appreciate your “performance.” Name ..."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
